>I'm wondering if anyone has any thoughts on surviving this bones file.  A
>wand of polymorph created a pet yellow dragon (who didn't manage to keep me
>alive). A later character found the bones...and the dragon is sitting on or
>next to the stairs. I died before I got any moves after walking down the
>stairs.  This death of course left bones again.
> Any ideas how to survive this other than pure luck or hoping next time I
>don't leave bones when it kills me?
>
If you can find a scroll of scare monster, drop it on the downstairs
on the level preceding the bones level. Then drop rocks until the
scroll falls down the stairs.Turn off autopickup and go downstairs.
As you get to the bones level (if it gets loaded) the Dragon will
immediately run away, you are then safe to throw rocks at it, dig to
the next level, whatever you want.

If you were to try Elbereth or something similar the Dragon may melee
you to death in the very first turn, this method gives you a
headstart.

The only problem is finding and identifying scrolls of scare
monster...

